<title>USA: US Stockpile receives no offers for manganese ore.</title>
<headline>US Stockpile receives no offers for manganese ore.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it received no offers for manganese ore on June 3.</p>
<p>The next offer will be July 1.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
